/11/2026-01/icf/191030643/unspecified/postcoordinationScale/capacity</code>, <code>http://id.who.int/icd/release/11/2026-01/icf/191030643/unspecified/postcoordinationScale/performance</code></td><td/><td/><td/><td>d131</td><td/><td>Learning through actions with objects and persons, unspecified</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">b4559<a name=\"terminologie-icf-b4559\"> </a></td><td>Fonctions non précisées de tolérance à l'effort</td><td/><td>b455</td><td>b4559</td><td/><td>category</td><td><code>https://icd.who.int/browse/2026-01/icf/fr#1409534054/unspecified</code>, <code>https://icd.who.int/browse/2026-01/icf/en#1409534054/unspecified</code></td><td><code>http://id.who.int/icd/release/11/2026-01/icf/1409534054/unspecified/postcoordinationScale/extentOrMagnitudeOfImpairment</code></td><td/><td/><td/><td>b455</td><td/><td>Exercise tolerance functions, unspecified</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">e2409<a name=\"terminologie-icf-e2409\"> </a></td><td>Facteurs non précisés relatifs à la lumière</td><td/><td>e240</td><td>e2409</td><td/><td>category</td><td><code>https://icd.who.int/browse/2026-01/icf/en#558848479/unspecified</code>, <code>https://icd.who.int/browse/2026-01/icf/fr#558848479/unspecified</code></td><td><code>http://id.who.int/icd/release/11/2026-01/icf/558848479/unspecified/postcoordinationScale/barrierOrFacilitator</code></td><td/><td/><td/><td>e240</td><td/><td>Light, unspecified</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">s3203<a name=\"terminologie-icf-s3203\"> </a></td><td>Langue</td><td/><td>s320</td><td>s3203</td><td><code>http://id.who.int/icd/entity/23483470</code></td><td>category</td><td><code>https://icd.who.int/browse/2026-01/icf/en#23483470</code>, <code>https://icd.who.int/browse/2026-01/icf/fr#23483470</code></td><td><code>http://id.who.int/icd/release/11/2026-01/icf/23483470/postcoordinationScale/natureOfChangeInBodyStructure</code>, <code>http://id.who.int/icd/release/11/2026-01/icf/23483470/postcoordinationScale/