2</code></td><td>category</td><td><code>https://icd.who.int/browse/2026-01/icf/fr#498218652</code>, <code>https://icd.who.int/browse/2026-01/icf/en#498218652</code></td><td><code>http://id.who.int/icd/release/11/2026-01/icf/498218652/postcoordinationScale/capacity</code>, <code>http://id.who.int/icd/release/11/2026-01/icf/498218652/postcoordinationScale/performance</code></td><td/><td/><td/><td>d610-d629</td><td>d6108, d6101, d6102, d6100, d6109</td><td>Acquiring a place to live</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">d3158<a name=\"terminologie-icf-d3158\"> </a></td><td>Communiquer - recevoir des messages non verbaux, autres formes précisées</td><td/><td>d315</td><td>d3158</td><td/><td>category</td><td><code>https://icd.who.int/browse/2026-01/icf/fr#1682771693/other</code>, <code>https://icd.who.int/browse/2026-01/icf/en#1682771693/other</code></td><td><code>http://id.who.int/icd/release/11/2026-01/icf/1682771693/other/postcoordinationScale/capacity</code>, <code>http://id.who.int/icd/release/11/2026-01/icf/1682771693/other/postcoordinationScale/performance</code></td><td/><td/><td/><td>d315</td><td/><td>Other specified communicating with - receiving - nonverbal messages</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">s7103<a name=\"terminologie-icf-s7103\"> </a></td><td>Articulations de la région de la tête et du cou</td><td/><td>s710</td><td>s7103</td><td><code>http://id.who.int/icd/entity/169456190</code></td><td>category</td><td><code>https://icd.who.int/browse/2026-01/icf/en#169456190</code>, <code>https://icd.who.int/browse/2026-01/icf/fr#169456190</code></td><td><code>http://id.who.int/icd/release/11/2026-01/icf/169456190/postcoordinationScale/natureOfChangeInBodyStructure</code>, <code>http://id.who.int/icd/release/11/2026-01/icf/169456190/postcoordinationScale/extentOrMagnitudeOfImpairment</code></td><td/><td/><td/><td>s710</td><td/><td>Joints of head and neck region</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">d1401<a name=\"terminologie-icf-d1401\">